  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low, cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/624e39d526acda184232f0a9/step-c0335468.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Thinly slice onion.\n• Cut haloumi into bite-size chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/624e39d526acda184232f0a9/step-ede2f9e4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, tossing, 3 mins. Set aside on a plate.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook carrot and onion until softened, 4-6 mins.\n• Add curry spice blend, remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/624e39d526acda184232f0a9/step-d107d553.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add passata, light cooking cream, brown sugar and cook until thickened, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir through mixed leaves and haloumi until wilted. Season to taste.\n• Divide rice and curry between bowls.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/624e39d526acda184232f0a9/step-5037be50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
